    {
      "id": "uv700ax",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "3. Early Conquests of Shivaji"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "n0egjes",
      "content": "• Captured Torna Fort in 1646."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "bk6jz8d",
      "content": "• Captured several forts in the Deccan region."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "lp0e3yl",
      "content": "• Defeated Afzal Khan, a general of Bijapur Sultanate."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "yz67emc",
      "content": "• Established control over many strategic forts."
    },
    {
      "id": "97ok999",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "4. Conflict with the Mughals"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "u3dswdd",
      "content": "• Shivaji fought several battles against Mughal forces."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "x18n1ku",
      "content": "• He attacked Surat in 1664."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9xc0tjv",
      "content": "• He was invited to the Mughal court by Aurangzeb but later escaped from Agra in 1666. "
    },
    {
      "id": "1qck9g2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
